ftp://linux01.gwdg.de/pub/cLIeNUX/interim/Forreal.tgz

is the most current osimplay and related work. osimplay was Slashdotted as
shasm. osimplay is my 386 assembler written entirely in Bash. Forreal is
the first demonstration of 32-bit unprotected mode on the 386, which Intel
chose not to document.

If you are doing any work in assembly, you owe it to yourself to be aware
of osimplay.

